            "text": "Before you start"
          }
        },
        "subheading_2": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Still unsure? Send us a message.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need a gym?",
            "answer": "<p>Each program lists the equipment it needs. Some need a full gym, others a pair of dumbbells.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I am a beginner. Where do I start?",
            "answer": "<p>Start with the foundation program. It teaches the main lifts and builds up slowly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I get the program?",
            "answer": "<p>You get a PDF and video links straight after checkout, and a copy by email.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long are the sessions?",
            "answer": "<p>Most sessions take 45 to 60 minutes, three or four times a week.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I ask the coach questions?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Coaching plans include weekly check ins. Program buyers can write in any time.</p>"
          }
        },
